As a student, I want to create an account using my university email so that only verified students can access the marketplace.
As a seller, I want to list items for sale with photos, descriptions, and prices so that other students can see what I’m offering.
As a buyer, I want to search and filter listings by category, price, and condition so that I can quickly find what I need.
As a user, I want to message other students on the platform so that I can negotiate prices or ask questions safely.
As a seller, I want to edit or remove my listings so that I can keep my items up to date or remove sold items.
As a buyer, I want to save or bookmark listings so that I can come back to items I’m interested in later.
As a user, I want to report suspicious or inappropriate listings so that the platform stays safe and trustworthy.
As a student, I want to see seller profiles with ratings or reviews so that I can decide whether to trust a seller.
As a user, I want notifications when I receive messages or when an item I’m watching changes so that I don’t miss important updates.
As a buyer or seller, I want to arrange meetups on campus or specify preferred locations so that transactions can happen conveniently and safely.
